     "titulo": "Amounts",
     "texto": [
      "After amount words like **kilo**, **litr** and **szklanka**, the product usually takes the genitive: **kilo jabłek**, **litr mleka**, **szklanka soku**.",
      "In English we use «of»; Polish has no separate word equivalent to it."
